MODULE: ServedNeverAheadScanReadsAlias
TARGET: ServedNeverAhead
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rebuild scans whatever copy the alias names rather than the copy it captured floors on and binds
PERTURBS: RebuildScan

--- FIND
    /\ rbVal' = SrcState(rbTree)
--- REPLACE
    /\ rbVal' = SrcState(alias)
--- END
